  "comparator_scope_note": "van Es et al. 2014 (PMID 24963045) is a scope-matched open-access pooled analysis of the six phase-3 acute symptomatic VTE DOAC-vs-VKA trials and reports recurrent VTE including VTE-related death as RR 0.90 (0.77-1.06). van der Hulle et al. 2014 (PMID 24330006) was checked first because it is the canonical JTH systematic review/meta-analysis, but Unpaywall reported open_access=false during the build, so it was not used as the gate comparator. The trial pool now declares the canonical endpoint as symptomatic recurrent VTE (DVT / nonfatal PE / fatal PE or VTE-related death) while retaining the trial-reported component phrases and literal analysis sets. The mixed trial-reported ratio measures are displayed as a pooled first-event ratio (five HRs and one RR). The EINSTEIN placebo extension embedded in PMID 21128814 is explicitly excluded as a wrong-comparator substudy."
